# ─── Rust / Cargo ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Workspace build output. Cargo normally writes everything to the
# top-level `target/`, but invoking `cargo` from inside a sub-crate
# directory leaves a nested `target/` behind — ignore both shapes.
/target
crates/*/target/

# rustfmt backup files (`cargo fmt --backup`).
**/*.rs.bk

# rustc internal-compiler-error crash dumps (`rustc-ice-<timestamp>-<pid>.txt`).
# Emitted to the crate root when a nightly toolchain panics mid-compile.
rustc-ice-*.txt

# Cargo's per-user snapshot (kept out of VCS, regenerable).
**/.cargo-ok

# ─── Trunk / WASM frontend ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Trunk regenerates these on `trunk build` / `just app-ui-build`.
/crates/app-ui/dist
/crates/ui-storybook/dist
/crates/wisp-chart-web/dist

# wasm-bindgen and wasm-pack scratch.
**/pkg/

# ─── Tauri ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tauri's `generate_context!()` writes JSON Schemas into `gen/` at build
# time (e.g. `crates/app/gen/schemas/*.json`). Regenerated on every build.
/crates/app/gen

# ─── macOS metadata ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
# DO NOT add bare `Icon` / `Icon?` here even though the upstream macOS
# gitignore template suggests them for Finder's `Icon\r` metadata file.
# `Icon?` is a glob — `?` matches any single character, including the
# `s` in our real `crates/app/icons/` directory on case-insensitive
# filesystems. That makes `cargo run -p screen-app --example regen-icons`
# silently drop the regenerated `icon.ico` from `git add`, and the
# Windows CI build fails with `icons/icon.ico not found` deep inside
# `tauri-winres`. The proper pattern for Finder's `Icon\r` is `Icon\r`
# (literal CR) which is hard to express in a text file; given the
# file is vanishingly rare on modern macOS, we omit it entirely.
# Resource forks created when copying files from non-macOS volumes.
._*
# Spotlight / Time Machine / Finder artifacts on shared volumes.
.Spotlight-V100
.DocumentRevisions-V100
.fseventsd
.TemporaryItems
.Trashes
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent

# ─── Windows metadata ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# ─── Linux metadata ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*~
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*

# ─── Editor / IDE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# JetBrains (WebStorm, IntelliJ, RustRover, CLion).
.idea/
*.iml
# VSCode — uncomment if you don't want to share workspace settings.
.vscode/
# Cursor.
.cursor/
# Zed.
.zed/
# Sublime.
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
# Vim.
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
Session.vim
.netrwhist
# Emacs.
\#*\#
.\#*
# Helix.
.helix/

# ─── Coverage / profiling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
lcov.info
cobertura.xml
coverage/
*.profraw
*.profdata
flamegraph.svg
perf.data*

# ─── Logs / scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
.cache/
tmp/

# ─── Environment files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `.env` itself can be committed if it only holds non-secret defaults; the
# `.local` variants and personal direnv overrides should not.
.env.local
.env.*.local
.envrc.local

# ─── Local Claude Code harness state ──────────────────────────────────────────
# `.claude/` holds per-machine session/scheduling state — not project-shared.
.claude/
# ...but `.claude/skills/` is intentionally project-shared: skill markdown
# files (e.g. `leptos-migration.md`) need to ship with the repo so every
# contributor's Claude session picks them up.
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**

# ─── Project / output scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# mdBook + rustdoc outputs land under target/ already, but keep these here
# in case someone does `mdbook build` without `--dest-dir` (writes to a
# `book/` subdirectory of the source root by default).
/_docs/book/book/
/_docs/wisp-book/book/
/_docs/wisp-chart-book/book/
/_docs/wisp-animation-book/book/
.cargo/config.toml
